  "methodology": {
    "source_navigation": "5 fresh connections per size; workspace/open is completed before timing. 31 reverse lookups per connection: first cold adapter tree, then 30 warm calls. Sparse synthetic declarations; only fixture target XML/modules exist. Measures adapter plus real stdio/backend, excludes VS Code rendering. No Cargo builds during sampling.",
