    "big_project": "../eska-playground/big_configuration_temp/src/buhmfo; read only. Root Configuration.xml SHA-256 checked before and after each series, not a whole-source hash. No 1C platform invocation.",
    "native": "Private profiles and owned synthetic projects. Native elapsedMs values are single functional acceptance timings, not comparative performance samples. Language-pack registration is not Russian UI acceptance."
